From 8a454a2a4a7fa990ba2cf09e6de63101e2278d2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: amichai-bd <amichaibd@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Feb 2024 17:34:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] WIP - CSR HW update correctly

---
 app/crt0/crt0_boot_trap.s                    |  2 +-
 app/defines/interrupt_handler.h              |  2 +-
 source/core_rrv/core_rrv_csr.sv              | 61 ++++++++++++--------
 verif/core_rrv/tb/core_rrv_no_ref_tb.sv      |  2 +-
 verif/core_rrv/tests/bubblesort_with_timer.c |  1 +
